{"id":"ab3ffad7f96cd03d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CProof.md","title":"CProof","display":"CProof","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CProof","parameters":["g","z261","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CProof"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>z261</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：经典命题。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>z261</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CProof g z261 a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ FormsC g)\n  (and\n    (@ FmC a)\n    (exists z264\n      (and\n        (@ Seq z261 z264)\n        (and\n          (@ Last z261 a)\n          (forall z262\n            (implies\n              (in z262 z264)\n              (exists z263\n                (and\n                  (@ App z261 z262 z263)\n                  (and\n                    (@ FmC z263)\n                    (or\n                      (in z263 g)\n                      (or\n                        (@ CAx z263)\n                        (exists z265\n                          (exists z266\n                            (and\n                            (exists z267 (exists z268 (and (in z267 z262) (and (@ App z261 z267 z268) (= z268 z265)))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z269 (exists z270 (and (in z269 z262) (and (@ App z261 z269 z270) (= z270 z266)))))\n                            (@ PImp z265 z263 z266)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eabdafb75566a144\" href=\"?note=eabdafb75566a144\" title=\"ZFC_CAx\">CAx</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"43d22035e7796b1d\" href=\"?note=43d22035e7796b1d\" title=\"ZFC_FmC\">FmC</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c0c9a9379a527254\" href=\"?note=c0c9a9379a527254\" title=\"ZFC_FormsC\">FormsC</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d72dedf3d7200b4b\" href=\"?note=d72dedf3d7200b4b\" title=\"ZFC_Last\">Last</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CProof g z261 a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CAx|CAx]]；[[ZFC_FmC|FmC]]；[[ZFC_FormsC|FormsC]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CAx","status":"resolved","id":"eabdafb75566a144","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Ap